   The HSZ40 (Raid Array 310) does not use the standard Hawker Cyclon
X Cell battery found in units like the HSZ70 and HSG80. It uses a
flat, rectangular battery which is installed inside the controller
housing (so you need to shut down the raid array and disassemble it
to change the battery). 

