Check out the OpenVMS FAQ for instructions on doing a "conversational"
boot to reset the SYSTEM password:

     http://h71000.www7.hp.com/faq/openvms_faq.html

If you have further interest in VMS, the complete set of docs is
available here:

     http://www.hp.com/go/doc

In particular, click on the "OpenVMS operating system" link on the left.

I expect that any version of VMS from 6.2 on will work.  Don't stop at
V7.3-1, go to at least V7.3-2.  The latest release is V8.3...

